---
const metadata = {
  title: 'Best Mary Jane Sneakers for Women 2026 — Classic Retro Style Meets All-Day Comfort | TechRuling',
  description: 'Discover the best Mary Jane sneakers for women in 2026. From classic retro leather to barefoot comfort — our curated pick delivers timeless style and all-day wearability.',
};

const heroProduct = {
  id: 1,
  name: "Women's Fashion Retro Mary Jane Sneakers",
  shortName: "Classic Retro Mary Jane",
  price: "$41.99",
  originalPrice: "$44.99",
  rating: 4.5,
  reviewCount: "2,847",
  image: "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/b4b1c1e9-7b1c-495b-9aeb-02aa13c355c9.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg",
  affiliateLink: "https://amzn.to/4bKZqjC",
  tagline: "Premium leather, adjustable strap, non-slip sole",
  badge: "🏆 #1 Classic Pick",
  reviewText: "Oh, these are so, so cute! I wear a 6.5, ordered such, and length-wise, a perfect fit. They seemed to be well-made, and were very comfy!",
  reviewStars: 5,
  benefits: [
    "Premium leather — water-resistant, looks premium",
    "Adjustable strap — customized fit every time",
    "Non-slip rubber outsole — safe on any surface",
    "Pairs perfectly with jeans, dresses, skirts",
  ],
};

const otherProducts = [
  {
    id: 2,
    name: "WHITIN Women's Barefoot Mary Jane Flats",
    shortName: "Barefoot Comfort Flats",
    price: "$44.95",
    originalPrice: "$59.95",
    rating: 4.6,
    reviewCount: "1,923",
    image: "https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/81VLuzYwGAL._AC_UL330_SR330,330_.jpg",
    affiliateLink: "https://amzn.to/4bCE2yj",
    badge: "🩰 Best Barefoot Pick",
    highlights: "Wide toe box · Zero drop sole",
  },
  {
    id: 3,
    name: "Women's Classic Retro Sneakers Slip On",
    shortName: "Classic Slip-On Sneakers",
    price: "$39.99",
    originalPrice: "$44.99",
    rating: 4.4,
    reviewCount: "3,156",
    image: "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ndKL7cJzL._AC_SY695_.jpg",
    affiliateLink: "https://amzn.to/4sDNrM0",
    badge: "⚡ Best Slip-On Pick",
    highlights: "No laces · Thin soft sole",
  },
  {
    id: 4,
    name: "Women's Fashion Classic Retro Sneakers",
    shortName: "Feminine Lace Detail Sneakers",
    price: "$38.99",
    originalPrice: "$52.99",
    rating: 4.7,
    reviewCount: "2,234",
    image: "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kUOx1BGWL._AC_SY695_.jpg",
    affiliateLink: "https://amzn.to/4sCoMHt",
    badge: "🌸 Best Feminine Pick",
    highlights: "Lace detail · Skate-inspired look",
  },
];
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=5">
<title>{metadata.title}</title>
<meta name="description" content={metadata.description}>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#FEF9F3;
  --card:#FFFFFF;
  --text:#1A1A1A;
  --text-mid:#555;
  --text-light:#888;
  --coral:#D4527A;
  --coral-dark:#B33D63;
  --sky:#3B9ED8;
  --gold:#F5A623;
  --border:#EEE6DD;
  --shadow:0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  --radius:16px;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  line-height:1.65;
  font-size:16px;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* ── HERO ── */
.hero{
  min-height:100dvh;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:20px 16px 120px;
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,#FDF0F5 0%,#FEF6F8 60%,#FEF9F3 100%);
  text-align:center;
  position:relative;
}
.hero::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%,rgba(212,82,122,0.07) 0%,transparent 65%);
  pointer-events:none;
}
.hero-badge{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  padding:6px 16px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--coral),#E07090);
  color:#fff;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}
.hero-badge span{font-size:16px}
.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(26px,7vw,46px);
  font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;
  letter-spacing:-0.5px;margin-bottom:10px;
}
.hero h1 span{display:block;color:var(--coral)}
.hero-sub{
  font-size:clamp(14px,3.5vw,17px);
  color:var(--text-mid);
  max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 24px;line-height:1.7;
}

/* ── HERO PRODUCT CARD ── */
.hero-product{
  background:var(--card);
  border-radius:20px;
  box-shadow:0 6px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
  overflow:hidden;
  max-width:460px;margin:0 auto 20px;
  text-align:left;
}
.hero-product-img{
  width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FDF8F5,#FDF0F5);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  padding:10px;position:relative;
}
.hero-product-img img{
  width:100%;height:100%;
  object-fit:cover;
}
.img-badge{
  position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--coral),var(--coral-dark));
  color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
  padding:5px 12px;border-radius:20px;
}
.hero-product-body{padding:18px 20px}
.hero-product-name{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.3}
.hero-product-tagline{font-size:13px;color:var(--coral);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px}
.hero-product-rating{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px}
.hero-product-stars{color:var(--gold);font-size:14px}
.hero-product-reviews{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-light)}
.hero-product-price{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:2px}
.hero-product-price-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:14px}
.hero-product-benefit{
  display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;
  padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);
  font-size:13px;color:var(--text-mid);
}
.hero-product-benefit::before{content:"✓";color:var(--sky);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}

/* ── HERO CTA ── */
.hero-cta{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  max-width:460px;margin:0 auto;
}
.hero-cta-btn{
  display:inline-block;width:100%;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--coral),var(--coral-dark));
  color:#fff;border-radius:16px;
  font-size:17px;font-weight:800;
  padding:16px 28px;text-decoration:none;
  box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(212,82,122,0.38);
  transition:transform 0.15s;
}
.hero-cta-btn:active{transform:scale(0.97)}
.hero-trust{
  font-size:12px;color:var(--text-light);
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;
}

/* ── STICKY CTA ── */
.sticky-cta{
  position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;
  background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--border);
  padding:12px 16px 18px;z-index:100;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  box-shadow:0 -4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.sticky-cta-info{flex:1}
.sticky-cta-price{font-size:20px;font-weight:800}
.sticky-cta-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-light)}
.sticky-cta-btn{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--coral),var(--coral-dark));
  color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:14px;
  font-size:15px;font-weight:800;
  padding:13px 22px;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;
  display:inline-block;
  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(212,82,122,0.38);
  transition:transform 0.15s;white-space:nowrap;
}
.sticky-cta-btn:active{transform:scale(0.97)}

/* ── WHY THIS ── */
.why-section{padding:52px 20px;background:#fff;text-align:center}
.why-section h2{font-size:clamp(20px,5vw,28px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:24px;letter-spacing:-0.3px}
.why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:14px;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto}
.why-card{background:var(--bg);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 14px;text-align:left}
.why-icon{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:8px}
.why-card h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px}
.why-card p{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mid);line-height:1.6}

/* ── SOCIAL PROOF ── */
.proof-section{padding:44px 20px;background:var(--bg)}
.proof-inner{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
.proof-quote{
  background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:24px 20px;margin-bottom:16px;
  border-left:4px solid var(--coral);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);text-align:left;
  position:relative;
}
.proof-quote::before{
  content:"“";font-size:56px;color:var(--coral);
  position:absolute;top:-6px;left:14px;line-height:1;opacity:0.2;
}
.proof-quote p{font-size:15px;color:var(--text-mid);line-height:1.75;font-style:italic;padding-left:6px}
.proof-stars{color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:2px}
.proof-author{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-light);font-weight:600;margin-top:8px}
.proof-verified{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;
  font-size:11px;color:#1A7F37;font-weight:600;
  background:#EBF7EE;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;
}

/* ── OTHER PICKS ── */
.other-section{padding:52px 20px;background:#fff}
.other-section h2{font-size:clamp(19px,4.5vw,25px);font-weight:800;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px}
.other-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:0 auto;max-width:860px}
.other-card{
  border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;
  padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;
  text-decoration:none;color:inherit;
  transition:border-color 0.2s,box-shadow 0.2s;
}
.other-card:hover{border-color:var(--coral);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(212,82,122,0.1)}
.other-card-img{
  width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FDF6F8,#FDF0F5);
  border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;
}
.other-card-img img{max-width:80%;max-height:72px;object-fit:contain}
.other-card-badge{
  display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;
  background:#FDF0F5;color:var(--coral);
  border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
}
.other-card h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4}
.other-card-price{font-size:17px;font-weight:800}
.other-card-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text-light)}
.other-card-highlights{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-mid)}
.other-card-cta{margin-top:auto;padding-top:8px;color:var(--coral);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}

/* ── FAQ ── */
.faq-section{padding:48px 20px;background:var(--bg)}
.faq-section h2{font-size:clamp(19px,4.5vw,25px);font-weight:800;text-align:center;margin-bottom:22px}
.faq-list{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto}
.faq-item{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)}
.faq-q{
  padding:15px 18px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;
  cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  user-select:none;
}
.faq-q::after{content:"+";font-size:20px;color:var(--coral);transition:transform 0.2s}
.faq-item.open .faq-q::after{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.faq-a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.3s,padding 0.3s;padding:0 18px}
.faq-item.open .faq-a{max-height:200px;padding:0 18px 14px}
.faq-a p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-mid);line-height:1.75}

/* ── FINAL CTA ── */
.final-section{padding:60px 20px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#FDF0F5,#FEF9F3);text-align:center}
.final-section h2{font-size:clamp(21px,5vw,29px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px}
.final-section p{font-size:15px;color:var(--text-mid);margin-bottom:22px}
.final-btn{
  display:inline-block;padding:16px 36px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--coral),var(--coral-dark));
  color:#fff;border-radius:16px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;
  text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(212,82,122,0.35);
  transition:transform 0.15s;
}
.final-btn:active{transform:scale(0.97)}

/* ── TRUST BAR ── */
.trust-bar{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:18px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.trust-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-mid);font-weight:600}
.trust-icon{font-size:15px}
.disclosure{padding:14px;text-align:center;color:var(--text-light);font-size:11px;background:var(--bg)}

/* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
@media(min-width:768px){
  .hero-cta{flex-direction:row;align-items:center}
  .hero-cta-btn{width:auto;flex:1}
  .sticky-cta-wrap{position:fixed;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:100%;max-width:460px;z-index:100;pointer-events:none}
  .sticky-cta{
    border-radius:0 0 16px 16px;max-width:460px;margin:0 auto;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    padding:12px 20px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(-100%);
    transition:opacity 0.3s,transform 0.3s;pointer-events:auto;
  }
  .sticky-cta-wrap.visible .sticky-cta{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
  .why-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ── STICKY CTA ── -->
<div class="sticky-cta-wrap" id="stickyWrap">
  <div class="sticky-cta">
    <div class="sticky-cta-info">
      <div class="sticky-cta-price">{heroProduct.price}</div>
      <div class="sticky-cta-note">⭐ {heroProduct.rating} · {heroProduct.reviewCount} reviews</div>
    </div>
    <a href={heroProduct.affiliateLink} class="sticky-cta-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      👟 See Price on Amazon →
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── HERO ── -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge"><span>👟</span> 2026 Women's Shoe Trends</div>

  <h1>The Best Mary Jane Sneakers <span>Under $45</span></h1>

  <p class="hero-sub">
    Timeless Mary Jane style meets all-day comfort.<br>
    <strong>Premium leather · Adjustable strap · Non-slip sole</strong>
  </p>

  <!-- Hero Product Card -->
  <div class="hero-product" id="hero-product">
    <div class="hero-product-img">
      <span class="img-badge">{heroProduct.badge}</span>
      <img src={heroProduct.image} alt={heroProduct.shortName} loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div class="hero-product-body">
      <div class="hero-product-name">{heroProduct.shortName}</div>
      <div class="hero-product-tagline">{heroProduct.tagline}</div>
      <div class="hero-product-rating">
        <span class="hero-product-stars">{"★".repeat(heroProduct.reviewStars)}</span>
        <span class="hero-product-reviews">{heroProduct.rating} · {heroProduct.reviewCount} reviews</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-product-price">{heroProduct.price} <span style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-light);text-decoration:line-through;font-weight:400">was {heroProduct.originalPrice}</span></div>
      <div class="hero-product-price-note">Premium leather · Amazon Prime delivery</div>
      {heroProduct.benefits.map(b => (
        <div class="hero-product-benefit">{b}</div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a href={heroProduct.affiliateLink} class="hero-cta-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      👟 See Price on Amazon →
    </a>
  </div>

  <p class="hero-trust">
    <span>🚚 Prime delivery</span>
    <span>↩️ 30-day returns</span>
    <span>🔒 Secure payment</span>
  </p>
</section>

<!-- ── WHY THIS ── -->
<section class="why-section">
  <h2>Why This Is Our #1 Pick</h2>
  <div class="why-grid">
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">👠</div>
      <h3>Premium Leather</h3>
      <p>Water-resistant leather looks expensive and lasts for years.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">🔧</div>
      <h3>Adjustable Strap</h3>
      <p>Customized fit for narrow or wide feet — no break-in needed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">🦶</div>
      <h3>Non-Slip Sole</h3>
      <p>Textured rubber outsole grips any surface safely.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card">
      <div class="why-icon">👗</div>
      <h3>Endlessly Versatile</h3>
      <p>Jeans, shorts, dresses, skirts — it goes with everything.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── SOCIAL PROOF ── -->
<section class="proof-section">
  <div class="proof-inner">
    <div class="proof-quote">
      <div class="proof-stars">{"★".repeat(heroProduct.reviewStars)}</div>
      <p>"{heroProduct.reviewText}"</p>
      <div class="proof-author">— Verified Amazon Buyer</div>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-verified">✓ Verified Purchase</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── OTHER PICKS ── -->
<section class="other-section">
  <h2>More Styles to Consider →</h2>
  <div class="other-grid">
    {otherProducts.map(p => (
      <a href={p.affiliateLink} class="other-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="other-card-img">
          <img src={p.image} alt={p.shortName} loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="other-card-badge">{p.badge}</span>
          <h3 style="margin-top:7px">{p.shortName}</h3>
          <div class="other-card-price">{p.price}</div>
          <div class="other-card-meta">{"★".repeat(Math.round(p.rating))} {p.rating} · {p.reviewCount} reviews</div>
          <div class="other-card-highlights">{p.highlights}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="other-card-cta">See on Amazon →</div>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── FAQ ── -->
<section class="faq-section">
  <h2>Quick Answers</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
      <div class="faq-q">Do Mary Jane sneakers run true to size?</div>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>Most customers find they run true to size. If you have wide feet, consider sizing up or choosing the Barefoot Comfort style with its wide toe box.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
      <div class="faq-q">Are these comfortable enough for all-day wear?</div>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — the cushioned insole and flexible rubber outsole make these comfortable for walking, commuting, and light errands. The adjustable strap prevents slipping.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
      <div class="faq-q">Can I wear them with formal outfits?</div>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>Absolutely. The classic retro leather style works well with business casual, dresses, and skirts — not just casual wear.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
      <div class="faq-q">How do I clean them?</div>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>Wipe with a damp cloth for daily care. For deeper cleaning, use mild soap and water. Avoid machine washing to maintain the leather shape and strap.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── FINAL CTA ── -->
<section class="final-section">
  <h2>👠 Step Into Timeless Style</h2>
  <p>{heroProduct.price} · Premium leather · Adjustable strap · Non-slip sole</p>
  <a href={heroProduct.affiliateLink} class="final-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    👟 Shop Top Pick on Amazon →
  </a>
</section>

<!-- ── TRUST BAR ── -->
<div class="trust-bar">
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">🚚</span> Prime Delivery</div>
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">↩️</span> 30-Day Returns</div>
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">🔒</span> Secure Amazon Pay</div>
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="trust-icon">💰</span> Commission earned</div>
</div>
<div class="disclosure">
  <p>As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases — but we only recommend products we'd buy ourselves.</p>
</div>

<script>
function toggleFaq(el){ el.classList.toggle('open'); }

(function(){
  var wrap = document.getElementById('stickyWrap');
  var hero = document.getElementById('hero-product');
  if (!wrap || !hero) return;
  new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
    entries.forEach(function(e){
      wrap.classList.toggle('visible', !e.isIntersecting);
    });
  },{ threshold: 0 }).observe(hero);
})();
</script>

</body>
</html>
